@startuml diagAtividades-etapa3-casoUso-en

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
'skinparam monochrome true

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF                      
  BorderColor      #000000                     
  FontColor        #000000                     
}

skinparam ActivityStartColor #000000
skinparam ActivityEndColor   #000000           
skinparam ArrowColor         #000000  

skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF    
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor     #000000

start

:Collection of all the system’s user stories;
:Prompt to implement the actors and their inheritance relationships in the system, based on all user stories:\n"Generate PUML use case code implementing only the actors, including inheritance relationships if any,\nconsidering the following user stories: <list of user stories>";

while (Are all actors implemented?) is (No)
  :Single corrective prompt for actor:\n"Implement actor W";
endwhile (Yes)

' Loop: coerência das heranças
while (Are the inheritance relationships between actors consistent with the real system?) is (No)
  :Single corrective prompt for inheritance:\n"Actor X inherits from Actor Y; Actor Z inherits from ...";
endwhile (Yes)

' Implementação dos casos de uso por ator
while (Are there any actors without implemented use cases?) is (Yes)
  :Prompt to implement the use cases of only one actor, based on their user stories:\n"In the previous PUML code, implement only Actor X’s use cases, based strictly\non the following user stories: <list of Actor X’s user stories>";
endwhile (No)

if (Does the system have dependency relationships?) then (Yes)
  
  while(Are the dependency relationships consistent?) is (No)
    :Prompt for dependency relationships («include»/«extend»):\n "Use case A occurs only if B occurs; Use case C may occur if ...";
  endwhile (Yes)
  stop
else (No)
  stop

@enduml